=2 Walkthrough
!Jugner Forest.jpg|right|Jugner Forest
* Speak to {n:Ramua} in {z:Northern San d'Oria} (E-3) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
** You need to have already signed up with the Woodworking Guild for this quest to be activated. Speak to {n:Guild Master}: {n:Cheupirudaux} - {z:Northern San d'Oria} (F-3)
* Ramua will give you the {@k} {k:Timber survey checklist} and a {@i:Hatchet|1021} {i:Hatchet|Hatchet|1021}.
** The one hatchet will probably break, so **buy more hatchets before you go.** {n:Ostalie} in {z:Southern San d'Oria} (E-9) is closest.
* Travel to {z:Jugner Forest} and log the following items:
** {@i:Arrowwood Log|688} {i:Arrowwood Log|Arrowwood Log|688}
** {@i:Ash Log|698} {i:Ash Log|Ash Log|698}
** {@i:Yew Log|696} {i:Yew Log|Yew Log|696}
** {@i:Willow Log|695} {i:Willow Log|Willow Log|695}
** {@i:Walnut Log|693} {i:Walnut Log|Walnut Log|693}
* If you've never harvested before: go to the green points marked on the wiki's map, and look for yellow sparkles called "Logging Point"s. Trade your hatchet to them for a chance at an item.
* **(Optional)** turn on the Records of Eminence objective Harvesting -> Original Areas -> Jugner Forest for sparks and experience. For the first clear, it'll also give you 12 hatchets.
* Trade these logs to Ramua, for your reward. She will also return the logs to you.

=2 Notes
* For each item on the list that you log, you will get a message that data was recorded on your checklist. It appears that you must acquire these items yourself, you cannot buy them from shops or the auction house.

